            {
              "who": "N",
              "s": "Persona 3",
              "zh": "第 3 個人",
              "en": "Person 3"
            },
            {
              "who": "M",
              "s": "Con cuarenta años me he matriculado en la universidad. Estudio Historia del Arte a distancia.",
              "zh": "四十歲的我註冊了大學，遠距念藝術史。",
              "en": "At forty I've enrolled at university. I'm studying Art History by distance learning."
